		{"id":"6a3900a122598364","type":"text","text":"- 73 - Initial context onboarding (global settings/ context for client) \n- 89 - Ensure that externalized context is being referenced for intelligence \n- 109 - General intelligence for file uploads \n- 47 - Inference quality \n- 104 - Topic labelling needs to be done (conversation/ file upload). For now, control with conversations/ questions to users.","x":-660,"y":-260,"width":1300,"height":200},
