		{"id":"bc7ef0f5fbbdacbc","type":"text","text":"* Once this is done, user should receive a notification -Pavan  \n- Ensure the quality of the inference being displayed on the UI; where it’s not making it to the UI, we should have retries at our end to fix the issue.-Pavan  \n- Status for source should not show Ready until fully done.  -Pavan+UI \n- The inference process takes too long today. Can we make this faster? -Pavan\n- 95 - Ensure this additional context goes into intelligence-,Meta spoc\n* 47 - Inference quality - Meta team","x":-660,"y":880,"width":1300,"height":280},
		{"id":"41e627fd189614af","x":1780,"y":-10,"width":800,"height":920,"type":"text","text":""},
		{"id":"c3af9ac8b93f5c65","x":1820,"y":110,"width":720,"height":460,"type":"text","text":"- **100 -** Option to replace a file with a new one and then run overall intelligence again – we’ll append for now (testing may produce scenarios that require a different solution) \n- **101** - What happens when we hit Refresh training – re-run the inference with the most recent files\n- **104** - Topic labelling needs to be done (conversation/ file upload). For now, control with conversations/ questions to users. \n- **109** - General intelligence for file uploads \n- **47** - Inference quality \n- **77** - Inference from files to go into intelligence (graph, table, data inference etc.) once user confirms\n- **15 -** Replacements/ refreshes need to be treated differently in the backend for historical data purposes"}
